        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mineral wool insulation 60mm, cladding with aluminium sheet
Production of a thermal insulation of pipes for heating systems;
UUID: 3414df0f-1bb4-3a88-aaec-c9c46ac162db
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for pipe insulation of heating systems in appartment and commercial buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3414df0f-1bb4-3a88-aaec-c9c46ac162db.xml</text>
